      "104/332 participants in pembrolizumab+lenvatinib arm discontinued due to AEs vs 68/338 in pembrolizumab+placebo arm",
      "Pembrolizumab+lenvatinib arm showed greater deterioration in QoL (GHS/QoL LS mean change -6.38 vs -2.69) and physical function (-9.50 vs -4.02)",
      "Time to true deterioration in GHS/QoL was shorter in combo arm (5.62 vs 24.58 months, HR=1.58)",
      "Time to true deterioration in physical function was shorter in combo arm (5.55 months vs not reached, HR=1.95)",
      "Higher rates of cardiac SAEs in pembrolizumab+lenvatinib arm including acute myocardial infarction (4/332) and acute coronary syndrome (2/332)"
